# Database Enumeration

### Identify databases

```text
--dbs
```

### Identify current database

```text
--current-db
```

### Identify current user

```text
--current-user
```

### Database users

```text
--users
```

### Database privileges

```text
--privileges
```

### Database roles

```text
--roles
```

---

# Tables

List tables from a database:

```text
-D <DATABASE> --tables
```

---

# Columns

List columns from a table:

```text
-D <DATABASE> -T <TABLE> --columns
```

---

# Dump Data

Dump table contents:

```text
-D <DATABASE> -T <TABLE> --dump
```

Dump an entire database:

```text
-D <DATABASE> --dump
```

Dump everything accessible:

```text
--dump-all
```

