# Authentication

### HTTP Basic Authentication

```text
--auth-type=<TYPE>
--auth-cred=<CREDENTIALS>
```

### HTTP Cookie

```text
--cookie="<COOKIE>"
```

### HTTP Header

```text
--headers="<HEADERS>"
```

Useful when the target requires an authenticated session.

---

# Request Files

Load a complete HTTP request:

```text
-r request.txt
```

This is particularly useful with requests captured in Burp Suite.

---

# Proxy

Route SQLmap traffic through a proxy:

```text
--proxy=<PROXY>
```

Useful for inspecting SQLmap requests through Burp Suite.

---

# User-Agent

```text
--user-agent="<USER-AGENT>"
```

### Random User-Agent

```text
--random-agent
```

---

# Tamper Scripts

SQLmap supports tamper scripts to modify payloads.

```text
--tamper=<SCRIPT>
```

Useful in certain filtering/WAF scenarios.

List available scripts:

```text
/usr/share/sqlmap/tamper/
```

