# OS Interaction

Depending on the DBMS, privileges, and configuration, SQLmap may provide OS-level functionality.

Potential options include:

| Option | Description |
|---|---|
| `--os-shell` | Attempt interactive OS shell |
| `--os-cmd=<CMD>` | Execute OS command |
| `--file-read=<FILE>` | Read a file |
| `--file-write=<FILE>` | Write a file |
| `--file-dest=<PATH>` | Destination for uploaded file |

These features require appropriate database privileges and target conditions.

